check 1
# A fallen (monstats 19, normal) poked next to the player in the Rogue
# Encampment, then its first 50 ticks compared (specs/tools/poke.md §2
# rule 6, test vector "poke-fallen-town"): ScnAma, -seed 1234, no input.
# Before frame 4 (after frame 3's snapshot): the game seed and the
# player's unit seed are set first, so the spawn draws from equal seeds
# on both sides whatever came before (d2rs is one game-seed step behind
# from the join, poke.md Test vectors), then the party is spawned.
# Compare the units with GUID 8-11 (the party) frame by frame; the town's
# own units carry the join difference.
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name poke-fallen-town
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 54
seconds 240
channels state
at 4 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 4 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 4 poke spawn 19 @x+3 @y+3 normal
